<title>UK: LIFFE cocoa mixed, coffee and sugar higher late AM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE cocoa mixed, coffee and sugar higher late AM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Higher in the nearbys, rest lower to steady. May and July 98 active. Nearby July up five at 1,043 stg at 1025 GMT.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Modestly higher but movements narrow after a mixed start. July up $7 at $1,669.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Holds recent gains in solid early volume. August up $1.60 at $316.00.</p>
</text>
